      "book": "Deuteronomy",
      "chapter": 6,
      "verse": 16,
      "startVerse": 16,
      "endVerse": 16,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "I’ve seen many people tempt God and fail. ”How did they fail?” You say. Well, they all end up dying anyway.",
