      "startVerse": 7,
      "endVerse": 8,
      "author": "1 Chronicles 28:20",
      "authorHandle": "",
      "text": "\"And David said to Solomon his son, Be strong and of good courage, and do it: fear not, nor be dismayed: for the LORD God, even my God, will be with thee; he will not fail thee, nor forsake thee, until thou hast finished all the work for the service of the house of the LORD.\" 1 Chronicles 28:20",
      "likes": 0,
      "isLikedByUser": false,
      "isBookmarkedByUser": false,
