      "chapter": 31,
      "verse": 7,
      "startVerse": 7,
      "endVerse": 8,
      "author": "John 17:12",
      "authorHandle": "",
      "text": "\"While I was with them in the world, I kept them in thy name: those that thou gavest me I have kept, and none of them is lost, but the son of perdition; that the scripture might be fulfilled.\" John 17:12",
      "likes": 0,
      "isLikedByUser": false,
      "isBookmarkedByUser": false,
